                                                "sense_id": "e8620073-b58a-34b9-873e-be2a9872e0c1",
                                                "text": "Doga instructors are not required to complete certification, though teacher training seminars do exist, like ones taught by Brenda Bryan, 43, a yoga and doga instructor in Seattle who has just written a book on the subject."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39a9c999-ca85-47c3-b14e-adc3359208b0",
                                                "sense_id": "e8620073-b58a-34b9-873e-be2a9872e0c1",
                                                "text": "As I waited to meet with Jay Graber, the CEO of Bluesky, on the 25th floor of an office building in downtown Seattle, I stared out at the city’s waterfront and thought: God fucking damn it."
                                            }
                                        ]
